"verse":"32","text":""},{"verse":"33","text":""},{"verse":"34","text":""},{"verse":"35","text":""}]},{"chapter":"16","verses":[{"verse":"1","text":"And the LORD said unto Samuel: ‘How long wilt thou mourn for Saul, seeing I have rejected him from being king over Israel? fill thy horn with oil, and go, I will send thee to Jesse the Beth-lehemite; for I have provided Me a king among his sons.’"},{"verse":"2","text":"And Samuel said: ‘How can I go? if Saul hear it, he will kill me.’ And the LORD said: ‘Take a heifer with thee, and say: I am come to sacrifice to the LORD."},{"verse":"3","text":"And call Jesse to the sacrifice, and I will tell thee what thou shalt do; and thou shalt anoint unto Me him whom I name unto thee.’"},{"verse":"4","text":"And Samuel did that which the LORD spoke, and came to Beth-lehem. And the elders of the city came to meet him trembling, and said: ‘Comest thou peaceably?’"},{"verse":"5","text":"And he said: ‘Peaceably; I am come to sacrifice unto the LORD; sanctify yourselves and come with me to the sacrifice.’ And he sanctified Jesse and his sons, and called them to the sacrifice."},{"verse":"6","text":"And it came to pass, when they were come, that he beheld Eliab, and said: ‘Surely the LORD’S anointed is before Him.’"},{"verse":"7","text":"But the LORD said unto Samuel: ‘Look not on his countenance, or on the height of his stature; because I have rejected him; for it is not as man seeth: for man looketh on the outward appearance, but the LORD looketh on the heart.’"},{"verse":"8","text":"Then Jesse called Abinadab, and made him pass before Samuel. And he said: ‘Neither hath the LORD chosen this.’"},{"verse":"9","text":"Then Jesse made Shammah to pass by. And he said: ‘Neither hath the LORD chosen this.’"},{"verse":"10","text":"And Jesse made seven of his sons to pass before Samuel. And Samuel said unto Jesse: ‘The LORD hath not chosen these.’"},{"verse":"11","text":"And Samuel said unto Jesse: ‘Are here all thy children?’ And he said: ‘There remaineth yet the youngest, and, behold, he keepeth the sheep.’ And Samuel said unto Jesse: ‘Send and fetch him; for we will not sit down till he come hither.’"},{"verse":"12","text":"And he sent, and brought him in. Now he was ruddy, and withal of beautiful eyes, and goodly to look upon. And the LORD said: ‘Arise, anoint him; for this is he.’"},{"verse":"13","text":"Then Samuel took the horn of oil, and anointed him in the midst of his brethren; and the spirit of the LORD came mightily upon David from that day forward. So Samuel rose up, and went to Ramah."},{"verse":"14","text":"Now the spirit of the LORD had departed from Saul, and an evil spirit from the LORD terrified him."},{"verse":"15","text":"And Saul’s servants said unto him: ‘Behold now, an evil spirit from God terrifieth thee."},{"verse":"16","text":"Let our lord now command thy servants, that are before thee, to seek out a man who is a skilful player on the harp; and it shall be, when the evil spirit from God cometh upon thee, that he shall play with his hand, and thou shalt be well.’"},{"verse":"17","text":"And Saul said unto his servants: ‘Provide me now a man that can play well, and bring him to me.’"},{"verse":"18","text":"Then answered one of the young men, and said: ‘Behold, I have seen a son of Jesse the Beth-lehemite, that is skilful in playing, and a mighty man of valour, and a man of war, and prudent in affairs, and a comely person, and the LORD is with him.’"},{"verse":"19","text":"Wherefore Saul sent messengers unto Jesse, and said: ‘Send me David thy son, who is with the sheep.’"},{"verse":"20","text":"And Jesse took an ass laden with bread, and a bottle of wine, and a kid, and sent them by David his son unto Saul."},{"verse":"21","text":"And David came to Saul, and stood before him; and he loved him greatly; and he became his armour-bearer."},{"verse":"22","text":"And Saul sent to Jesse, saying: ‘Let David, I pray thee, stand before me; for he hath found favour in my sight.’"},{"verse":"23","text":"And it came to pass, when the [evil] spirit from God was upon Saul, that David took the harp, and played with his hand; so Saul found relief, and it was well with him, and the evil spirit departed from him."}]},{"chapter":"17","verses":[{"verse":"1","text":""},{"verse":"2","text":""},{"verse":"3","text":""},{"verse":"4","text":""},{"verse":"5","text":""},{"verse":"6","text":""},{"verse":"7","text":""},{"verse":"8","text":""},{"verse":"9","text":""},{"verse":"10","text":""},{"verse":"11","text":""},{"verse":"12","text":""},{"verse":"13","text":""},{"verse":"14","text":""},{"verse":"15","text":""},{"verse":"16","text":""},{"verse":"17","text":""},{"verse":"18","text":""},{"verse":"19","text":""},{"verse":"20","text":""},{"verse":"21","text":""},{"verse":"22","text":""},{"verse":"23","text":""},{"verse":"24","text":""},{"verse":"25","text":""},{"verse":"26","text":""},{"verse":"27","text":""},{"verse":"28","text":""},{"verse":"29","text":""},{"verse":"30","text":""},{"verse":"31","text":""},{"verse":"32","text":""},{"verse":"33","text":""},{"verse":"34","text":""},{"verse":"35","text":""},{"verse":"36","text":""},{"verse":"37","text":""},{"verse":"38","text":""},{"verse":"39","text":""},{"verse":"40","text":""},{"verse":"41","text":""},{"verse":"42","text":""},{"verse":"43","text":""},{"verse":"44","text":""},{"verse":"45","text":""},{"verse":"46","text":""},{"verse":"47","text":""},{"verse":"48","text":""},{"verse":"49","text":""},{"verse":"50","text":""},{"verse":"51","text":""},{"verse":"52","text":""},{"verse":"53","text":""},{"verse":"54","text":""},{"verse":"55","text":""},{"verse":"56","text":""},{"verse":"57","text":""},{"verse":"58","text":""}]},{"chapter":"18","verses":[{"verse":"1","text":""},{"verse":"2","text":""},{"verse":"3","text":""},{"verse":"4","text":""},{"verse":"5","text":""},{"verse":"6","text":""},{"verse":"7","text":""},{"verse":"8","text":""},{"verse":"9","text":""},{"verse":"10","text":""},{"verse":"11","text":""},{"verse":"12","